<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>org.dishanagalawatta.SkillManager</id>
  <name>SkillManager</name>
  <summary>A professional tool for managing reusable agent skills across repositories</summary>
  <description>
    <p>SkillManager is a professional desktop tool for managing reusable agent skills across repositories.</p>
    <p>It ships a deep QML/PySide6 integration with a buttery-smooth native UI built from custom glass components, dark mode, and animated transitions.</p>
    <p>Key features include Quick Copy for one-click deployment of skills to any configured project target, skill packages with versioning and auto-updates, a global hotkey to summon the UI from anywhere, a native MCP server for agent-driven headless skill management, and a dark-mode QML interface.</p>
  </description>
